# .semgrepignore — path exclusions for semgrep (gitignore syntax).
#
# Read by the GitLab-side Probe SAST scanner (and local semgrep runs). Probe
# honors repo-root tool config files (.gitleaks.toml, .banditrc) but NOT inline
# `# nosemgrep` comments — so adjudicated false positives in NON-PRODUCTION
# files are excluded here by path.
#
# SCOPE POLICY (deliberately conservative — see issue #2314 / triage #2312):
# Only non-production files are path-excluded. Production source files are NOT
# listed here, even when they carry adjudicated-FP findings, because a path
# exclude blinds semgrep to ALL future (potentially real) findings in that file.
# Production-source FPs are handled by rule-level suppression instead, not here.
#
# Each entry below is a verified false positive (Probe scan 2026-06-28, #2312).

